WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
What is a fraction? A fraction is a part of a whole.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Split the whole into two equal parts. One part is one half: 1/2.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Split it into four equal parts. One part is one quarter: 1/4.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Two quarters are the same as one half: 2/4 = 1/2.
